<div class="space-y-12">
    <div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">REST API Reference</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-400">HTTP API on port 5020 powered by Axum &mdash; JSON endpoints for every data type, plus health and metrics</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Info -->
    <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/30">
        <p class="text-slate-400">SoliKV exposes two interfaces: the <a href="/docs/tcp-protocol" class="text-indigo-400 hover:text-indigo-300 transition-colors">Redis protocol</a> on port 6379 (RESP2/RESP3), and this REST API on port 5020 for HTTP access to all data types. Both share the same engine: persistence, replication, ACL and keyspace notifications cover both. Set <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">--rest-port 0</code> to disable the REST API.</p>
        <p class="text-slate-400">Replies are the JSON form of the command's reply: a bare string, number or array; <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">null</code> with HTTP 404 for a missing value; <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">{{"result":"OK"}}</code> for OK; <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">{{"error": "…"}}</code> with HTTP 400 for an error, 403 for a permission error or a refused command.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Authentication -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-yellow-500/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-yellow-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z" /></svg>
            </span>
            Authentication
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-400">When a password, a REST token or ACL users are configured, requests authenticate with one of:</p>
        <ul class="text-slate-400 space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>&bull; <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;</code> &mdash; the token is <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">--rest-token</code> (or <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">--rest-token-file</code>), else the <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">requirepass</code> password. It acts as the ACL user <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">--rest-token-user</code> (<code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">default</code>).</li>
            <li>&bull; <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">Authorization: Basic &lt;base64(user:password)&gt;</code> &mdash; any ACL user.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-slate-400">Every route is checked against the user's ACL like the command it runs (403 with a <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">NOPERM</code> error otherwise). Missing or wrong credentials give 401; ten failures from one address within the window give 429 for 30 s. A request without credentials does not count as a failure. On a loopback bind only the Host names <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">localhost</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">127.0.0.1</code> and <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">::1</code> (plus <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">--rest-allowed-hosts</code>) are answered, which stops DNS-rebinding attacks from a browser (421 otherwise). Over <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">--rest-max-connections</code> (1024) connections, new ones get 503. With <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">--tls-cert</code>/<code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">--tls-key</code> the REST port serves HTTPS.</p>
        <div class="rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-white/10 overflow-hidden">
            <div class="p-4 font-mono text-sm">
                <div class="text-slate-500"># With authentication enabled (--requirepass secret123)</div>
                <div class="text-emerald-400">curl -H "Authorization: Bearer secret123" \</div>
                <div class="text-emerald-400 ml-4">http://localhost:5020/kv/mykey</div>
                <div class="text-white mt-1">"hello"</div>
                <div class="text-slate-500 mt-3"># As an ACL user</div>
                <div class="text-emerald-400">curl -u reader:secret http://localhost:5020/kv/cache:home</div>
                <div class="text-slate-500 mt-3"># Missing or invalid token returns 401</div>
                <div class="text-emerald-400">curl http://localhost:5020/kv/mykey</div>
                <div class="text-white mt-1">{"error":"Unauthorized"}</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Key-Value (Strings) -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 7a2 2 0 012 2m4 0a6 6 0 01-7.743 5.743L11 17H9v2H7v2H4a1 1 0 01-1-1v-2.586a1 1 0 01.293-.707l5.964-5.964A6 6 0 1121 9z" /></svg>
            </span>
            Key-Value (Strings)
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono">GET</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/kv/:key</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Get the value of a key: a JSON string, or <code class="text-white">null</code> with HTTP 404 if the key does not exist.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-orange-500/20 text-orange-400 text-xs font-mono">PUT</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/kv/:key</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Set a key to a string value with optional TTL.</p>
                    <div class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500 font-mono">{"value": "hello", "ex": 3600}</div>
                    <div class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1"><code>ex</code> = TTL in seconds, <code>px</code> = TTL in milliseconds (optional)</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-red-500/20 text-red-400 text-xs font-mono">DELETE</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/kv/:key</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Delete a key. Returns the count of keys deleted.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Lists -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-cyan-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 6h16M4 10h16M4 14h16M4 18h16" /></svg>
            </span>
            Lists
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono">GET</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/list/:key?start=0&amp;stop=-1</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Get a range of elements from the list (LRANGE). Defaults to all elements.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 text-xs font-mono">POST</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/list/:key/lpush</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Push values to the head of the list. Returns new list length.</p>
                    <div class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500 font-mono">{"values": ["a", "b", "c"]}</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 text-xs font-mono">POST</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/list/:key/rpush</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Push values to the tail of the list. Returns new list length.</p>
                    <div class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500 font-mono">{"values": ["x", "y"]}</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 text-xs font-mono">POST</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/list/:key/lpop</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Remove and return the first element.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 text-xs font-mono">POST</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/list/:key/rpop</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Remove and return the last element.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Hashes -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10" /></svg>
            </span>
            Hashes
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono">GET</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/hash/:key</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Get all fields and values (HGETALL).</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono">GET</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/hash/:key/:field</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Get a single field value (HGET).</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-orange-500/20 text-orange-400 text-xs font-mono">PUT</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/hash/:key</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Set one or more hash fields (HSET).</p>
                    <div class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500 font-mono">{"fields": {"name": "Alice", "age": "30"}}</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-red-500/20 text-red-400 text-xs font-mono">DELETE</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/hash/:key/:field</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Delete a hash field (HDEL).</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sets -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-pink-500/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-pink-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" /></svg>
            </span>
            Sets
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono">GET</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/set/:key</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Get all members (SMEMBERS).</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-orange-500/20 text-orange-400 text-xs font-mono">PUT</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/set/:key</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Add members (SADD). Returns count of new members added.</p>
                    <div class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500 font-mono">{"members": ["redis", "nosql", "fast"]}</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-red-500/20 text-red-400 text-xs font-mono">DELETE</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/set/:key/:member</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Remove a member (SREM).</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sorted Sets -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-orange-500/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-orange-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 4h13M3 8h9m-9 4h6m4 0l4-4m0 0l4 4m-4-4v12" /></svg>
            </span>
            Sorted Sets
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono">GET</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/zset/:key?start=0&amp;stop=-1</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Get members with scores in rank order (ZRANGE WITHSCORES).</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-orange-500/20 text-orange-400 text-xs font-mono">PUT</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/zset/:key</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Add members with scores (ZADD).</p>
                    <div class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500 font-mono">{"members": [{"score": 100, "member": "alice"}, {"score": 200, "member": "bob"}]}</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- HyperLogLog -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-violet-500/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-violet-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z" /></svg>
            </span>
            HyperLogLog
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 text-xs font-mono">POST</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/pfadd/:key</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Add elements to a HyperLogLog. Returns 1 if any register was altered, 0 otherwise.</p>
                    <div class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500 font-mono">{"elements": ["alice", "bob", "charlie"]}</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono">GET</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/pfcount/:key</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Return the approximate cardinality of the HyperLogLog.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 text-xs font-mono">POST</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/pfmerge/:dest</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Merge multiple HyperLogLogs into a destination key.</p>
                    <div class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500 font-mono">{"sources": ["hll1", "hll2"]}</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bloom Filter -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-rose-500/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-rose-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 4a1 1 0 011-1h16a1 1 0 011 1v2.586a1 1 0 01-.293.707l-6.414 6.414a1 1 0 00-.293.707V17l-4 4v-6.586a1 1 0 00-.293-.707L3.293 7.293A1 1 0 013 6.586V4z" /></svg>
            </span>
            Bloom Filter
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 text-xs font-mono">POST</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/bf/reserve/:key</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Create an empty Bloom filter with a given error rate and capacity.</p>
                    <div class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500 font-mono">{"error_rate": 0.001, "capacity": 10000}</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 text-xs font-mono">POST</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/bf/add/:key</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Add an item to the Bloom filter. Returns 1 if newly added, 0 if it may have existed.</p>
                    <div class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500 font-mono">{"item": "hello"}</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono">GET</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/bf/exists/:key/:item</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Check if an item may exist in the filter. Returns 1 (maybe exists) or 0 (definitely not).</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono">GET</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/bf/info/:key</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Return information about a Bloom filter (capacity, size, filters, items inserted).</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Geospatial -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-teal-500/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-teal-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z" /><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" /></svg>
            </span>
            Geospatial
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 text-xs font-mono">POST</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/geo/:key/add</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Add geospatial items (longitude, latitude, member) to a sorted set.</p>
                    <div class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500 font-mono">{"members": [{"longitude": 13.361389, "latitude": 38.115556, "member": "Palermo"}]}</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono">GET</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/geo/:key/pos/:member</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Return the longitude and latitude of a member.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono">GET</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/geo/:key/dist/:member1/:member2?unit=km</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Return the distance between two members. Unit: m, km, ft, mi (default: m).</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 text-xs font-mono">POST</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/geo/:key/search</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Search for members within a radius or bounding box.</p>
                    <div class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500 font-mono">{"longitude": 15, "latitude": 37, "radius": 200, "unit": "km", "count": 10, "sort": "ASC", "withcoord": true, "withdist": true}</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">GEOHASH and GEOSEARCHSTORE are available via the <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">POST /cmd</code> generic endpoint.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bitmap -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 5a1 1 0 011-1h14a1 1 0 011 1v2a1 1 0 01-1 1H5a1 1 0 01-1-1V5zM4 13a1 1 0 011-1h6a1 1 0 011 1v6a1 1 0 01-1 1H5a1 1 0 01-1-1v-6zM16 13a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v6a1 1 0 01-1 1h-2a1 1 0 01-1-1v-6z" /></svg>
            </span>
            Bitmap
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 text-xs font-mono">POST</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/bitmap/:key/setbit</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Set or clear the bit at offset. Returns the original bit value.</p>
                    <div class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500 font-mono">{"offset": 7, "value": 1}</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono">GET</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/bitmap/:key/getbit/:offset</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Returns the bit value at offset. Returns 0 if key missing or offset beyond length.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono">GET</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/bitmap/:key/bitcount?start=N&amp;end=N</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Count set bits in the string. Optional start/end specify a byte range.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">BITOP is available via the <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">POST /cmd</code> generic endpoint.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Generic Command -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-indigo-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 9l3 3-3 3m5 0h3M5 20h14a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" /></svg>
            </span>
            Generic Command Endpoint
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-400">Execute a data command via HTTP, for everything without a dedicated route. Administrative and keyspace-wide commands are refused with 403: <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">FLUSHDB</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">FLUSHALL</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">SHUTDOWN</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">DEBUG</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">EVAL</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">EVALSHA</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">SCRIPT</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">MODULE</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">SAVE</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">BGSAVE</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">BGREWRITEAOF</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">REPLICAOF</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">SLAVEOF</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">CLUSTER</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">CONFIG</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">MIGRATE</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">RESTORE</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">OBJECT</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">KEYS</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">SCAN</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">HSCAN</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">SSCAN</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">ZSCAN</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">RENAME</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">RENAMENX</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">RESET</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">LATENCY</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">MEMORY</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">WAIT</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">FAILOVER</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">CLIENT</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">INFO</code>, <code class="text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">DBSIZE</code> (the last two have their own routes).</p>
        <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 text-xs font-mono">POST</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/cmd</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Execute any command by name with arguments.</p>
                    <div class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500 font-mono">{"command": "HSET", "args": ["user:1", "name", "Alice", "age", "30"]}</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Server -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-cyan-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" /></svg>
            </span>
            Server
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono">GET</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/info</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Server information (equivalent to INFO command)</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono">GET</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/dbsize</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Returns the number of keys in database 0</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono">GET</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/health</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Liveness: <code class="text-white">{"status":"ok"}</code>. Never authenticated.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono">GET</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/ready</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Readiness: 200 <code class="text-white">{"status":"ready"}</code>, or 503 <code class="text-white">{"status":"busy"}</code> while a script runs past <code class="text-white">--busy-reply-threshold</code>. Never authenticated.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10">
                <span class="shrink-0 px-2 py-1 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono">GET</span>
                <div class="flex-1">
                    <code class="text-white">/metrics</code>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Prometheus text format: every numeric <code class="text-white">INFO</code> field as a gauge <code class="text-white">solikv_&lt;field&gt;</code>, the keyspace per database (<code class="text-white">solikv_keyspace_keys{db="0"}</code>), and per-command counters (<code class="text-white">solikv_command_calls_total</code>, <code class="text-white">_duration_seconds_total</code>, <code class="text-white">_rejected_total</code>, <code class="text-white">_failed_total</code>). Needs the token when one is set, unless <code class="text-white">--metrics-auth no</code>.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Example Session -->
    <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Example Session</h2>
        <div class="rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-white/10 overflow-hidden">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-white/5 border-b border-white/5">
                <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-500/60"></div>
                <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-500/60"></div>
                <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-500/60"></div>
                <span class="ml-2 text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono">Terminal</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 font-mono text-sm">
                <div class="text-slate-500"># Set a key with 1-hour TTL</div>
                <div class="text-emerald-400">curl -X PUT http://localhost:5020/kv/session:abc \</div>
                <div class="text-emerald-400 ml-4">-H "Content-Type: application/json" \</div>
                <div class="text-emerald-400 ml-4">-d '{"value":"token123","ex":3600}'</div>
                <div class="text-white mt-1">{"result":"OK"}</div>
                <div class="text-slate-500 mt-3"># Get a key</div>
                <div class="text-emerald-400">curl http://localhost:5020/kv/session:abc</div>
                <div class="text-white mt-1">"token123"</div>
                <div class="text-slate-500 mt-3"># Push to a list</div>
                <div class="text-emerald-400">curl -X POST http://localhost:5020/list/queue/rpush \</div>
                <div class="text-emerald-400 ml-4">-H "Content-Type: application/json" \</div>
                <div class="text-emerald-400 ml-4">-d '{"values":["job1","job2","job3"]}'</div>
                <div class="text-white mt-1">3</div>
                <div class="text-slate-500 mt-3"># Set hash fields</div>
                <div class="text-emerald-400">curl -X PUT http://localhost:5020/hash/user:1 \</div>
                <div class="text-emerald-400 ml-4">-H "Content-Type: application/json" \</div>
                <div class="text-emerald-400 ml-4">-d '{"fields":{"name":"Alice","age":"30"}}'</div>
                <div class="text-white mt-1">2</div>
                <div class="text-slate-500 mt-3"># Get all hash fields</div>
                <div class="text-emerald-400">curl http://localhost:5020/hash/user:1</div>
                <div class="text-white mt-1">["name","Alice","age","30"]</div>
                <div class="text-slate-500 mt-3"># Execute any command via /cmd</div>
                <div class="text-emerald-400">curl -X POST http://localhost:5020/cmd \</div>
                <div class="text-emerald-400 ml-4">-H "Content-Type: application/json" \</div>
                <div class="text-emerald-400 ml-4">-d '{"command":"ZADD","args":["leaderboard","100","alice","200","bob"]}'</div>
                <div class="text-white mt-1">2</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
